WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.290
I see.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.450
Reiji Akaba is leading the Lancers himself.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:11.390
Truthfully, Reiji Akaba was also the 
reason I left the Standard Dimension.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.990
You know Reiji Akaba?

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.560
But how?

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.300
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:27.070
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:32.360
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:10.980
The Aquaria Project

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:12.790
Three years ago,

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:16.380
Reiji Akaba traveled through dimensions, 
searching for his father.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.250
We're not done talking!

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:21.350
What do you mean by invade and destroy?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.990
It's to unite all the worlds into one.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.010
Where am I?

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:48.330
Sent to the Standard Dimension by his father,

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.660
Reiji Akaba used the research 
his father had left with him

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.430
to reach a conclusion.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:56.890
In other words,

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.260
my father is trying to use duels

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.860
to take control of the four dimensions.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.250
I...

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.630
The reason I dismissed my father,

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:11.500
assuming the Leo Corporation's presidency,

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:14.140
was also to stop his ambitions.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:20.410
That's why I want you to lead the 
Lancers, our combat squad!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.650
I understood, with painful clarity, 
what he was trying to say.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.660
But I had worked with Leo Akaba

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:36.630
to create the Real Solid Vision 
system and Action Duels,

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.840
so I thought I could speak to him.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.810
With that in mind,

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.340
I appropriated the dimensional transport 
that Reiji's research team

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.390
had developed independently,

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.310
and I headed for Academia.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.010
And that...

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.010
Yes.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:59.260
That was the day of my championship 
match with Strong Ishijima.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.440
My dad will come!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.960
Until he does, I'll face you!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.420
That's enough, Yuya!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.420
Duel me, Ishijima!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.970
I need to tell Yuya at once.

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:15.530
That his father left by himself 
to save everyone...

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:20.280
But I never reached Academia.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.380
The next thing I knew, I was 
in another dimension.

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:29.060
There, I met duelists who could 
control Xyz Monsters.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:34.320
I taught them that duels existed 
to make people smile.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:37.060
But soon, that peaceful city

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.290
was attacked by Academia.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.490
Sir...

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.260
Sir, it's time for your treatment.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.090
Mr. Sakaki... His leg...

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:58.170
Yes, it's because of Edo.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:02.750
Asuka, why is Academia mounting 
this interdimensional war?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.290
The Academia students

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:08.950
are fighting to create an ideal world, 
where everyone can live in peace.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.930
The plan's name is the "Aquaria Project."

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.660
The Aquaria Project?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.720
The Professor's plan is

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.870
to unite the four dimensions into one, 
creating a new, ideal world.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.840
But in practice...

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:33.320
It's a plan for Academia's invasion of 
other dimensions, to rule over them.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.920
One year ago, the order was finally given,

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:41.800
and Edo was selected as 
the supreme commander.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:47.200
I wasn't chosen for the first deployment,

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.340
but if I'd been ordered to, I'd have 
joined the army at once.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:58.730
We were taught that the Aquaria Project 
was the right way to save the world.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:02.700
And I was confident in the dueling 
skill I had refined for that purpose.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.980
I set out a change of clothes.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.200
Asuka, thank you.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.470
Take your time.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.620
The first deployment is back!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.590
The heroes have returned!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:18.360
How many did you turn into cards?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.440
Twenty-five, and you?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.960
Thirty! I win!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:27.000
That was so fun... Almost like 
a hunting game.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.570
I hope we get deployment orders again soon.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.350
What's wrong? What happened?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.160
The others all seem so happy...

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.380
How could I be happy?

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.110
After what we did...

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.080
I don't know how they can laugh about it!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.650
What you did?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:53.120
We turned humans... into cards.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:57.700
Well, it's a duel... What else can you do?

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:01.120
Doing the right thing always involves sacrifice.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.070
I'm sure the enemy duelists tried their—

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:04.790
It wasn't only duelists!

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.880
On-site, we received orders

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:12.080
to fully subjugate the Xyz Dimension

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:14.650
by turning ordinary people into cards!

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.610
Ordinary people?

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:20.590
Yes... Even defenseless people, everyone!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:24.560
We turned so many people into cards, 
screaming and crying.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.610
Even children and women.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:29.990
Even the elderly... everyone!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.500
How can this be the right thing to do?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.330
I never want to do that again.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.320
Come on, let's run away!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.480
Run away? Me, too?

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:49.580
I don't want them to make you 
do something so awful.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.340
I trusted Academia. I trusted the Professor.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:02.570
I thought the Aquaria Project, 
uniting the four dimensions,

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:04.130
sounded like a wonderful thing.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.220
He said that uniting

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:11.030
the dimensions would create an ideal world 
where everyone could live happily.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.670
I thought I could make 
her understand that, too.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:14.970
But...

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:23.210
Even the disloyal can serve a purpose 
in the Aquaria Project's cause.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.180
Serve a purpose?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.780
Stand back!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:40.970
What?!

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:01.160
That's when you met Yuya's father?

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.120
Yeah.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.620
But right after that, he collapsed.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.460
Because of Edo?

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:13.280
Yes. He had just fought Edo 
in the Xyz Dimension,

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.440
and had been thrown across dimensions.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.790
He told me everything...

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.680
What happened in the Xyz Dimension.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.110
Everyone else here, too.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.630
They were sent to the Xyz Dimension,

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.850
and were traumatized by what they had to do.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:36.190
I wanted to teach them his "make people 
smile with duels" philosophy,

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:39.700
so he and I formed this You Show School.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:45.420
My dream is to save as many of my former 
Academia classmates as I can,

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.240
and one day go after Academia.

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:51.470
Asuka, let me help you with your dream!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:53.070
If there's anything I can do...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.670
Asuka, emergency!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:55.540
What's wrong?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.420
We were helping this girl, 
when Academia saw us.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:00.400
Our allies...

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:12.320
Remaining to avenge your lost allies...

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.720
What a beautiful display of friendship.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.030
However,

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.260
I think you're going to regret it.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.760
Ah, well...

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.970
My orders are to turn all

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:31.940
who stand against Academia into cards, so...

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.860
Maybe I'll just do you all simultaneously.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.880
At least it'll kill some time.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:43.120
Let's enjoy ourselves.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.680
Duel!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.760
I summon Predaplant Squid 
Drosera from my hand.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:56.430
Then, I activate Continuous 
Spell Predator Planter,

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:01.940
to Special Summon Predaplant Moray 
Nepenthes, with its effect negated.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:08.730
No player can attack on their first turn.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.380
Thus, I end my turn.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.150
My turn!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.850
I activate my spell card Polymerization 
from my hand!

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:21.930
I fuse Steamroid, Drillroid, and 
Submarineroid in my hand!

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:23.830
Fusion Summon!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:28.180
Appear, Super Vehicroid Jumbo Drill!

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.480
Another traitor who escaped 
from Academia, right?

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:36.010
Impressive that you summoned 
Fusion Monsters so shamelessly.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:37.290
Shut up!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.720
Academia should be ashamed.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.480
I don't want to use duels 
to sadden anyone else...

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:46.950
I swore I'd only duel for what's really right!

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.420
What's really right?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.090
To use my duel to make everyone smile!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.440
I now end my turn.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.500
Use your duel to make everyone smile?

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.790
But that's impossible!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:03.770
After all, duels are winner-take-all things. 
Only the winner gets to smile.

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:07.030
Our teacher taught us...

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:14.510
Duels should make the winner, the loser, 
and everyone watching smile.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.200
My turn!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:19.680
I also activate spell card Polymerization 
from my hand.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:23.450
I fuse Big Koala and Des Kangaroo!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.920
Fusion Summon!

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:28.080
Come out, Master of Oz!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.860
Duels have the power to make everyone smile!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:35.180
I now end my turn!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.770
I guess you want to be turned 
into cards, with a smile...

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.310
Because I don't intend to lose.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.660
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.780
How do you expect to win, five against one?

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.580
You can lose and smile all you want.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:50.750
My turn!

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:55.150
I activate spell card Polymerization 
from my hand!

00:12:55.150 --> 00:13:00.360
I fuse Ojama Green, Ojama Yellow, 
and Ojama Black in my hand!

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.830
Fusion Summon!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.200
Come out, Ojama King!

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.330
Hey... What is that?

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.110
See? You're smiling!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.040
As long as Ojama King is in 
faceup position on the field,

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:26.220
three of your Monster Zones 
are rendered unusable!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:31.420
An unpleasant appearance and effect.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.520
Let's go.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:34.730
My turn!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:38.630
I summon V-Tiger Jet from my hand!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.730
And I activate my Continuous 
Spell Frontline Base,

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:48.810
and use its effect to Special 
Summon W-Wing Catapult!

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.750
You aren't using a Polymerization card?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.480
I can Fusion Summon without one.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.650
I banish V-Tiger Jet and W-Wing 
Catapult from the field,

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.690
to Fusion Summon VW-Tiger Catapult!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.450
So you can make these, too?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.990
You've been having lots of fun, right?

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:17.370
Smile while you still can.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:20.580
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.730
My turn!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.040
I summon X-Head Cannon!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.480
And I activate my Continuous 
Spell Frontline Base,

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.450
to Special Summon Y-Dragon 
Head from my deck!

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:39.620
And I activate my spell card Foolish Burial!

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.260
I send Z-Metal Tank from 
my deck to my graveyard.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:48.040
Then, I activate my spell card 
Iron Call from my hand.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:53.980
I Special Summon the Z-Metal Tank I 
sent to my graveyard, effect negated!

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:59.440
Now, I have my X, Y, and Z 
monsters on the field.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:05.260
I banish those three, to Fusion 
Summon XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.120
You're pretty good, as well...

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.760
Not at all like your predecessor.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.250
Brag while you still can!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:26.270
I activate the monster effect of 
XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:30.780
I discard one card to destroy 
Moray Nepenthes!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:36.030
Here, I thought I was safe because 
you couldn't attack on the first turn,

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.610
but your effect really got me.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.480
It isn't over yet...

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.780
We have even more to do!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:44.460
Now, we brothers really show our stuff.

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:50.160
I activate my trap card Fellow's Gift!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:54.040
I grant control of VW-Tiger
 Catapult to my little brother!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.560
Thanks, big brother.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:02.410
I banish my VW-Tiger Catapult 
and my XYZ-Dragon Cannon,

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:06.870
to Fusion Summon VWXYZ-Dragon 
Catapult Cannon!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:22.460
Wow... You brothers are really in sync.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.190
VWXYZ-Dragon Catapult 
Cannon's monster effect.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:30.170
Once per turn, I can banish one 
card on your side of the field!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.200
I banish Squid Drosera.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.670
Well?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:39.380
Now, you have no more monsters!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:44.250
In that instant, Squid Drosera's 
monster effect activates.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.680
When this card leaves the field,

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.950
a predator counter is placed on all your 
Special Summoned monsters.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.660
What?

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:56.160
Now, go on and end your turn...

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.860
And I'll get to have my fun.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.330
I... I end my turn.

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:02.890
Here I go, then.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:04.040
My turn!

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:09.040
In that instant, I pay 800 life 
points as a cost, to activate

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:11.210
Continuous Spell Predator Planter.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.510
And then, I activate its effect!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:18.630
I Special Summon Moray Nepenthes from 
the graveyard, with its effect negated.

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:23.920
Then, I summon Predaplant Flytrap!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.640
I think it's time to show him off.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.970
I activate Polymerization from my hand,

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.130
to fuse Flytrap and Moray Nepenthes!

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:42.870
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:48.850
Now become one, and from the hell 
of your petals, birth a new terror!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.050
Fusion Summon!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:54.480
Appear, poisonous dragon 
with hungry fangs,

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:58.620
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:06.930
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon's 
monster effect...

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.270
Until the end of my turn,

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:12.250
the total attack points of all Special 
Summoned monsters on your field,

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.700
is added to its own.

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:15.310
What?!

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:17.550
The attack points of all Special Summoned...

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:19.140
...monsters on our field?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.850
13,000 attack points?!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:32.560
Once per turn, Starving Venom can use 
an effect of one of your monsters.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.030
I'm going to borrow your monster's effect.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:39.000
Super Vehicroid Jumbo Drill's?!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.310
Yes,

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:44.840
since it can deal piercing damage 
to a defense-position monster.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.160
Now, I think it's time to get started.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.640
First, you, without a monster.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:51.570
Go.

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:54.900
Direct attack, Starving Venom 
Fusion Dragon!

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:03.200
And I send Predaplant Squid Drosera 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.790
to activate its monster effect.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.780
Once this turn, Starving Venom 
Fusion Dragon,

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:14.770
which just did battle, must attack each 
monster with a predator counter!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.120
Go.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:19.620
Attack Super Vehicroid Jumbo Drill!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.820
Attack Master of Oz...

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.590
Attack Ojama King.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:46.820
Last, attack VWYXZ-Dragon 
Catapult Cannon!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:00.010
That was quick.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:06.010
It hardly killed any time.

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:16.550
Oh?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.860
So you're here, too.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.170
You know him?

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:23.830
Yeah, I met him in the Standard 
and Synchro Dimensions.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.580
He's the little weasel after me.

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:28.920
What a rude thing to say...

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:32.590
I do have a name. It's Joeri.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.900
Call me by that, Yuzu.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.740
But I'm glad I ran into you.

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.880
The Professor will be overjoyed.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.490
Now... Come with me.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:46.290
Damn you! You won't escape this time!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:53.990
He disappeared?

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.950
Where? Where did he go?!

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.480
Hugo, what are you doing here?

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.910
You... You're alive?

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.880
Yuzu... Yuzu!

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.910
Yuzu!

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:18.940
When Sergey knocked you off 
the track, I thought you'd died.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:21.210
Don't say creepy stuff like that!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.410
What?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.930
Forget it. Have you heard, Yuzu?

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.000
Academia is here.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.700
Which means that Rin...

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.460
Not only Rin. Academia also 
has Ruri and Serena.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:33.170
Serena, too?

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:35.370
Yeah, she was taken.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.990
Right in front of Yuya and me.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:47.760
The army's dispatch made it clear that 
those who use Pendulum Summon,

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:50.520
the Lancers, have appeared in Heartland.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:54.560
For the Aquaria Project to 
continue undisturbed,

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:57.250
they must be purged.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.500
Go on.

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:02.250
Manoro won't be any use...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:05.310
And Edo also has very little 
combat experience.

00:22:05.310 --> 00:22:10.470
Yes, I suppose that is why he needs us.

00:22:12.340 --> 00:22:13.620
I can't wait.

00:23:51.350 --> 00:23:54.980
Syun risked his life in a duel, to tell 
Kaito about the importance of allies.

00:23:54.980 --> 00:23:58.560
So I swear, I'll bring Kaito back!

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:02.150
You wouldn't see a Heartland citizen 
walking around on their own.

00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:04.640
Thus, they must be with the Lancers, right?

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:07.130
We're lucky, meeting one so 
soon after arriving, Grace.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:08.760
Before rendezvousing at HQ,

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:12.580
let's take them as souvenirs for Edo 
and Manoro, my dear sister Gloria.

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:17.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Duel-Starved Amazonesses.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.030
The fun is only getting started!
